{"id": "itm_power-2026-10-16-018", "date": "2026-10-16", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 42, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": ["itm_power", "nel"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["green_hydrogen_cost"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.7, "reasons": ["多公司提及"]}, "title": "The Hydrogen Stream: P2X starts selling renewable methane to European markets", "content": "<p>Europe’s renewable hydrogen and e-fuels sector continues to gain momentum, with new developments spanning e-methane certification and offtake, electrolyser technology, large-scale green hydrogen projects and strategic investments. Recent announcements from companies including P2X Solutions, Stargate Hydrogen, ITM Power, Nel and Hy24</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/16/the-hydrogen-stream-p2x-starts-selling-renewable-methane-to-european-markets/\">The Hydrogen Stream", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/16/the-hydrogen-stream-p2x-starts-selling-renewable-methane-to-european-markets/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-10-16-019", "date": "2026-10-16", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 42, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["green_hydrogen_cost"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "China could produce the cheapest green hydrogen", "content": "<p>China could produce green hydrogen at an average cost of $120/MWh, significantly less than Germany, the United States and Japan, according to researchers at the University of Cologne. The analysis highlights China's cost advantages and the supply security risks associated with hydrogen imports.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/16/china-can-produce-the-cheapest-green-hydrogen/\">China could produce the cheapest green hydrogen</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://ww", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/16/china-can-produce-the-cheapest-green-hydrogen/", "type": "rss"}]}
